<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_VC39g</defName>
    <label>VC39 Accelerator Rifle</label>
    <description>One of the earlier and more successful prototypes in the Helghan charged weaponry program, the VC-39 was still considered extremely expensive and hard to produce by manufacturers, especially within successor states. Visari Corporation never stopped producing the armament however, and now discerning snipers across the helghan diaspora seek this weapon out. Forgoing traditional gas operated slugs, this is a true charge weapon, assembled to the exacting specifications of Visari-Corp and battle tested, even on Helghan itself during her final years. Early problems with jamming and battery life have been resolved through iterative improvements. It does not possess the same raw stopping power as an anti-materiel rifle, and its range is slightly low for a spacer-tier sniper, but its high accuracy burst fire system guarantees multiple hits on target per trigger pull, making this a much loved weapon by snipers on the move attached to frontline infantry. For isolated squads, the drawbacks of a high cost and slow manufacture time are low prices to pay.</description>
