  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_VC5rifle</defName>
    <label>VC5 Arc Rifle</label>
    <description>Produced in secrecy during the war under the misleading name of 'Arc Welder', this rifle is the end result of experimentation from the Visari Corporation into electrical petruscite weaponry that began with the success of the TR-X Teslite. Using similar principles, it harnesses petruscite to create a controlled catalytic charge along magnetic wire to direct bolts of raw electricity through the air and at targets. The range is somewhat low, but it results in the same stunning and EMP behavior of the Teslite grenade. Ultimately, the Visari Corporation ruled that while the weapon was a success, it fulfilled no tactical role on the battlefield, and was expensive compared to practical solutions. The arc technology would be later scaled up to more devastating effect as a defensive emplacement.</description>
