  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_VC5Array</defName>
    <label>VC5 Super Arc Array</label>
    <description>A very limited-run item, created a handful of times prior to the loss of Helghan, the Arc Array was actually an upscaled series of VC5 Arc Rifles affixed to modified heavy industrial equipment to create a 'heavy' version of the rifle for power armor units. The design intention was to create a potent anti drone/anti tank hardkill system that would neutralize vehicle crew and shut down internal electronics, in testing, this goal wasnt always achieved- variable hull density, electronic grounding, and other factors ensured that its intended role as an AT system was pushed to the side in development. That said, like all Arc weapons, it was found to be highly potent against infantry targets,The VC5 array can bypass traditional electrical proofing on infantry armor like rubberised suits and fry the target to a crisp. Surviving a blast from the VC5 has a stunning, disorienting effect on the human body that ensures the target is an easy mark. Its main drawback was always its somewhat low range, particularly for this heavy of a weapon. It is an excellent killing machine in all other respects, except perhaps its high cost to manufacture, Helghast successor states occasionally deploy them in the hands of their 'heavy' troopers to help take down hard targets in close.</description>
